:: Bad Ending 3 [en end Scene3.2] {"position":"1875,450","size":"100,100"}
{
(set: $sanity to it - 8)
(set: $dialogs to (a: 
  "We followed the strange voices and pushed the door open.",
  "There was nothing inside. Just an empty room. //Just as relief washed over me, a pale mist surged up from the floor—silent, rising like a tide.//.",
  "|imp>[A warning from the rules flashed through your mind.] That's the monster's hallucination— exactly what they'd warned us about." ,
  "Damn it! Close your eyes!",
  "Before we could even react, the mist had already risen to our necks. The thick, suffocating mist crawled into our lungs, //I could feel it reaching every single bone of my body, freezing every organ and cell to death. //
!",
  "…I’m sorry…",
  "Samuel’s voice drifted through the fog. Neither of us made it.",
  "//As my conciousness faded gradually, (text-style:'fade-in-out')[I took my one last breath.]//",
  "|shake>[Cause of death: Hunted by the first kind of monsters —The Illusion.]"
))

(set: $names to (a: "", "", "", "Me", "", "Samuel", "", "", "THE END"))
(set: $step to 1)
(set: $msgName to $names's ($step))
(set: $nextPassage to "none")

(display: "DialogBox")
(display: "Styles")
}

