:: Ending 1 [en end] {"position":"7000,775","size":"100,100"}
{<!-- ENDING 1: DEFEAT OUTCOME
     Unlocked when: Player escapes BUT has low sanity (<60%)
     Outcome: Becomes complicit in the cycle of injustice
     Themes: Apathy, moral weakness, conformity
     Player becomes part of the machine -->
//The Grand Finale: Ending 1//}
{
(set: $dialogs to (a: 
  "I kept the SCP insignia I found inside the amusement park— the last trace of Mark.",
  "When news of the disappearances finally broke, the entire country was shaken. Within hours, the SCP Foundation sealed off the park completely, turning it into a forbidden zone under strict containment.",
  "But even after escaping that nightmare, the world outside felt no different.",
  "Online, cruelty still spread unchecked. Mockery. Judgment. Harassment. People tearing each other apart for sport.",
  "And I couldn’t forget what I saw inside the park. Those creatures—those “monsters”— behind their blood‑stained eyes were years of pain, resentment, and suffering no one had ever cared to see.",
  "I used to be one of the silent ones. One of the people who looked away.",
  "But now I understand:",
  "Silence is agreement. Silence is complicity. Silence is telling every victim of cruelty, “You deserved it.”",
  "Maybe I can’t change the world. Maybe I can’t save anyone.",
  "But this time— I refuse to stay silent."
))

(set: $names to (a: "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", ""))

(set: $step to 1)
(set: $msgName to $names's ($step))
(set: $nextPassage to "none")

(display: "DialogBox")
(display: "Styles")

<audio src="https://cdn.freesound.org/previews/731/731716_15403889-lq.mp3
" autoplay>
}

|choices)[
(button:)[(link: "Restart")[(restart:)]]
]

(display: "Styles")


:: Ending 2 [en end] {"position":"7000,900","size":"100,100"}
{<!-- ENDING 2: DEFEAT OUTCOME
     Unlocked when: Player escapes BUT has low sanity (<60%)
     Outcome: Becomes complicit in the cycle of injustice
     Themes: Apathy, moral weakness, conformity
     Player becomes part of the machine -->
//The Grand Finale: Ending 2//
(set: $dialogs to (a: 
  "The world kept turning.",
  "The hateful comments kept multiplying. Victims trapped in endless waves of cyberbullying continued to endure the attacks.",
  "Tomorrow, there would be new victims. The day after, more. There would always be more.",
  "And I did nothing.",
  "I lay on my bed and closed my eyes.",
  "In the darkness of my dreams, the child from the maze stared at me. No blame. No anger. Just a quiet, steady gaze.",
  "As if asking: “You know the truth now… so why are you still doing nothing?”",
  "I had no answer.",
  "I turned over, pulling the blanket over my head, pretending sleep could hide me from the question. Pretending ignorance could absolve me.",
  "I still didn’t reach out to help anyone. I was still afraid— afraid of losing my audience, afraid of being attacked, afraid of standing alone against the crowd, afraid of being branded a freak for speaking up.",
  "And so, I remained silent."
))

(set: $names to (a: "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", ""))

(set: $step to 1)
(set: $msgName to $names's ($step))
(set: $nextPassage to "none")

(display: "DialogBox")
(display: "Styles")

<audio src="https://cdn.freesound.org/previews/731/731716_15403889-lq.mp3
" autoplay>
}

|choices)[
(button:)[(link: "Restart")[(restart:)]]
]


