:: Enforcement by Blood [en Scene2.3] {"position":"1600,500","size":"100,100"}
{
<!-- SCENE 2.3: FIRST ENCOUNTER WITH MONSTER
     Creatures begin slaughtering rule-breakers
     Player must choose: hide or flee -->
(set: $dialogs to (a: 
  "A blood-curdling shriek ripped through the darkness. In the dim light, I saw a staff member in a red uniform—his hand, now a jagged claw, had gutted a man holding a professional camera. Fresh blood began to seep from the jagged wound. The staffer’s face was a twisted, contorted mask of flesh, utterly inhuman.",
  'Panic erupted. Some tried to call for help, only to find the lines dead. Others, driven by a morbid, stunned reflex, actually held up their phones to record. As more rules were broken, more of these "alternates" emerged from the shadows. Violators were slaughtered on the spot.',
  "|imp>[Enjoy the show.]",
  "|imp>[Help me—!]",
  "A young man nearby screamed, breaking the silence rule. In an instant, his upper body was severed from his waist, collapsing at my feet. A spray of warm, metallic blood drenched my clothes.",
  "(My mind went completely numb. The stench of iron filled the air.)",
  "Suddenly, the creature turned toward me.",
  "|imp>[Photography is strictly prohibited inside the venue.]",
  '((text-style:"shudder")[It hissed, its distorted face inching closer.])',
  "What will you do?"
))
(set: $names to (a: "", "", "Host", "???", "", "", "", "Staff","", ""))
(set: $step to 1)
(set: $msgName to $names's 1)
(set: $nextPassage to "none")
(set: $audioTriggerStep to 4)
(set: $audioUrl to "https://cdn.freesound.org/previews/547/547964_6229882-lq.mp3")

(display: "DialogBox")
(display: "Styles")
}

|choices)[
  (button:)[[Stand your ground, too terrified to move]]
  (button:)[[Immediately scramble back a few steps]]
]


