{
(set: $dialogs to (a: 
  '(Someone startling me with (text-style:"blink")[a pat on the shoulder suddenly.])',
  'Whoa! You scared me! Samuel!',
  "(Yes, that's my college friend, Samuel. We've been through a lot together.)", 
  'What are you doing here?',
  'I’ve seen a lot of people visiting this place recently. (text-style:"bold")[My friend told me that the circus show is the most brilliant one he had ever seen.] Therefore, I am here to watch it. And you?',
  "This park has become so popular lately; of course, I had to ride the wave of popularity. That I've heard some visitors are completely obsessed, going three or four times a week—that seems exaggerated.",
  'Three or four times? Who goes to the same park multiple times? Crazy!',
  'By the way, who was that person earlier?'
))
