{
(set: $hasRulesBrochure to true)
(set: $dialogs to (a: 
  'We arrived at the main gate of the circus and joined the queue. The tent was a striking shade of crimson; with the upbeat music and the constant hum of chatter.',
  '(The place felt lively—on the surface, at least.)',
  '((text-style:"shudder")[Dealt with.] What kind of place uses a word like that?)',
  'I stared at that final line, a sudden shiver involuntary (text-style:"shudder")[rippling through my body].',
  'It was all too bizarre. First that terrified drifter, and now this unsettling atmosphere. My suspicious nature began to kick in. (I haven’t stumbled into a horror novel, have I?)',
  'Samuel noticed my hesitation and tried to comfort me.',
  "Are you okay? You’ve been acting strange since we got here.",
  'What will you do?'
))
(set: $step to 1)
(set: $names to (a: "", "", "", "", "", "", "Samuel", ""))
(set: $msgName to $names's 1)
