:: page23.B.3 [en Scene4.1] {"position":"2775,650","size":"100,100"}
{
(set: $dialogs to (a: 
  "I flipped through a few of the scattered notes. They read: “1234,” “9999,” “2468,” “1357”…",
  "(Most of them were written with ordinary black pens or pencils. Some had smiley faces, crosses, or check marks in the corners—clearly left by different people.)",
  "(But a few stood out.)",
  "(One note had “0319” written in thick red marker, the numbers bold and impossible to miss. No symbols in the corner—just an arrow pointing directly toward the door.)",
  "(Another note read “3820”, written in elegant cursive on pale pink paper. It looked almost decorative among the yellowed scraps around it.)",
  "(And in the very center of the wall, pinned like a warning, was a note written in blue highlighter: “4717” Beneath it, a small line of text: “The rarest combination.”)",
  "Do you think these unusually eye‑catching numbers might be the answer?"
))

(set: $names to (a: "", "", "", "", "", "", "Clara"))

(set: $step to 1)
(set: $msgName to $names's ($step))
