  "Don’t turn around!",
  "That’s Mabel!",
  "Mabel? The mascot on the rules",
  "Run!",
  "Fighting back our fear, we forced ourselves not to look behind. We ran frantically, searching for an indoor place to hide, but the sound behind us never faded. We reached the door of the office next to the circus—only to find it stuck. We had no way out.",
