:: page32.A [en Scene7] {"position":"4550,825","size":"100,100"}
{
(set: $dialogs to (a: 
  "The amusement park’s main gate had long been sealed shut—escaping through it was nearly impossible.",
  "If the rules were truly meant to mislead us, then some of them were likely written by the illusions themselves…",
  "to lure us into traps,",
  "or to keep us away from the real exit.",
  "One rule said: \"Do not approach strong lights.\"",
  "But when we first entered the park, I remembered seeing a strange, blinding flash near the parking lot.",
  "(What if that wasn’t danger?)",
  "(What if that was the exit—)",
  "(and they warned us away because they didn’t want us to reach it?)",
  "While hiding and observing, I learned something else:",
  "There’s an employee passage that leads directly to the parking lot.",
  "Staff and security use it to transport equipment and do patrols.",
  "If we can find it and avoid the guards, we might escape.",
  "But both ends of the passage require a staff ID card.",
  "Sometimes workers drop theirs.",
  "If we search carefully, we might find one.",
  "It’s now 3:40 AM.",
  "The guards have already begun their patrols.",
  "Our time is running out.",
  "Samuel swallowed hard.",
  "So… what do we do now…"
))

(set: $names to (a: "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "Samuel"))
(set: $step to 1)
(set: $msgName to $names's ($step))
(set: $nextPassage to "none")

(display: "DialogBox")
(display: "Styles")

<audio src="https://cdn.freesound.org/previews/646/646483_12295155-lq.mp3
" autoplay>
}

|choices)[
(button:)[[Look for a staff ID card->page33.A]]
(button:)[[Search for the passage directly->page33.C]]
(button:)[[Go back->page31]]
]


:: page32.B [en Inventory Scene7] {"position":"4550,1000","size":"100,100"}
{
<div class="letter">
(link-reveal: "''Dreamland Amusement Park — Night Security Patrol Protocol''")[<br>
To maintain safety and order during nighttime hours, all security personnel must complete their patrol in the following sequence and clock in at each designated checkpoint using the E-card system: <br>
0. Inspect all amusement facilities to ensure equipment is functioning normally.
0. Inspect Park Avenue/Main Street, confirming the area remains clean and tidy. Any irregularities must be corrected immediately.
0. Clock in at every checkpoint to record patrol efficiency."
---
Required Clock-In Route (in order): <br>
Security Department → Park Facilities → Park Avenue/Main Street → Staff Office → Security Department <br>
---
Night Shift Schedule <br>
Security personnel must conduct patrols during the following hours: <br>
12:00–01:00 <br>
03:00–04:00 <br>
06:00–07:00 <br>
] </div>
(set: $dialogs to (a: 
  "You find a Protocol"
))

