:: page34.C [en Inventory Scene7] {"position":"5125,1050","size":"100,100"}
{
<div class="letter">
(link-reveal: "''The Story of the Mabel''")[<br>
A girl who had just finished her college entrance exams wanted to celebrate the end of years of exhausting study. <br>
She dyed her hair a bright color, got a small tattoo, and went on a family trip. <br>
But after posting her photos online, she became the target of vicious attacks. <br>
<br>
People called her |letter>[shameless.] <br>
Said she was |letter>[showing off her body.] <br>
Said she was |letter>[trying to attract men.] <br>
Said a student should be |letter>[modest, obedient, conservative.] <br>
<br>
|letter>[The harassment spread like wildfire.] <br>
<br>
In the end, unable to endure the relentless cruelty of the internet, the girl jumped into the river and ended her life.
] </div>

(set: $sanity to it + 5)
(set: $dialogs to (a: 
  "The amusement park was located near where it happened.",
  "These words were left by Mark under the news article.",
  "After reading it, all of us went silent—our minds completely blank.",
  "Especially me.",
  "Five years ago, I watched the entire situation explode online in real time.",
  "As a content creator, I wanted to speak up for her.",
  "But I was afraid.",
  "Afraid of being attacked.",
  "Afraid of losing followers.",
  "Afraid of trouble.",
  "She had such a bright future ahead of her…",
  "And I did nothing.",
  "Astor stared at the screen, stunned.",
  "So… that horrifying, bloodthirsty monster… was once a victim pushed to the edge by people?",
  "Is everything here… driven by the hatred and revenge of these broken souls?"
))

(set: $names to (a: "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "Astor", "Astor"))
(set: $step to 1)
(set: $msgName to $names's ($step))
(set: $nextPassage to "none")

